Subject: [PATCH] Add gated guest continuations for EC conditional backedges

Family: CondJump NZCV/CBZ/CBNZ/TBZ/TBNZ, Jump stitching and fast-ret.
Gate absent/0: old behavior; 1: guest-live flags; 2: exact NZCV experiment.
R1 probes: each mode 150000 suspensions, arithmetic/control state exact.
REP and non-LSE retry loops excluded by curator scope; LSE NEG/CAS debt explicit.
Not a complete GetContext R2 implementation; see R2-OBSERVABILITY-DEBT.md.
Target release: 1.0.8. WOW64 and timing remain pending; REVIEW snapshot.

